  <p id="c-zizhitongjian-140-chulingqu-marriage:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">十一月，丁卯，詔罷世宗東田，毀興光樓。</p>
  <p id="c-zizhitongjian-140-chulingqu-marriage:p002" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">己卯，納太子妃<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-140-chulingqu-marriage:p002:m0007" ref="6fs_tis_zoa_AA">褚氏</persName>，大赦。妃，<persName id="c-zizhitongjian-140-chulingqu-marriage:p002:m0015" ref="6fs_tis_zoa_A">澄</persName>之女也。</p>
